          "end": 34.173,
          "en": "which we have in this dummy project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.32,
          "end": 39.21,
          "en": "For that, I'll use a h2 tag for the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.21,
          "end": 42.473,
          "en": "And then, below that I want to have that delete button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.89,
          "end": 47.48,
          "en": "Now, I'm using regular HTML elements here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.48,
          "end": 51.49,
          "en": "because when working with JSX you can use your own elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.49,
          "end": 53.65,
          "en": "your own components if you have some,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.65,
          "end": 58.18,
          "en": "but you can also use all the built in default browser tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.18,
          "end": 63.18,
          "en": "like divs, paragraphs, h1 tags, buttons, inputs, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 63.67,
          "end": 65.72,
          "en": "So, in the end, here in the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 65.72,
          "end": 68.37,
          "en": "we just write the HTML code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 68.37,
          "end": 71.84,
          "en": "that should eventually appear on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 71.84,
          "end": 75.38,
          "en": "So, the output that should be rendered by the browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 75.38,
          "end": 77.2,
          "en": "So, for this, we have our todo item here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.2,
          "end": 79.2,
          "en": "and some title above it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.2,
          "end": 83.03999999999999,
          "en": "And on that button, I'll now say Delete,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.03999999999999,
          "end": 85.5,
          "en": "that was the text we had here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.5,
          "end": 88.16,
          "en": "Now, for styling purposes, we're going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 88.16,
          "end": 90.837,
          "en": "to add some styling soon, I'll add another div here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.837,
          "end": 95.32,
          "en": "and actually put that button inside of that div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.32,
          "end": 98.64,
          "en": "And now I pressed this format document shortcut",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.64,
          "end": 102.023,
          "en": "to auto format this code and make it a bit more readable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.16,
          "end": 106.02000000000001,
          "en": "Now, that's a more complex HTML structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.02000000000001,
          "end": 109.95,
          "en": "And if we now save this file and we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.95,
          "end": 112,
          "en": "or actually we don't even need to reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112,
          "end": 115.85,
          "en": "because of this auto reloading built into the dev server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.85,
          "end": 117.93,
          "en": "we should see that output here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.93,
          "end": 121.34,
          "en": "the title, the delete button, and My Todos.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.34,
          "end": 124.15,
          "en": "Now, the delete button is not doing anything at the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.15,
          "end": 127.24,
          "en": "And the title also is just static text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.24,
          "end": 130.16,
          "en": "But we, again, see that we can influence",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.16,
          "end": 131.78,
          "en": "what shows up in the browser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.78,
          "end": 136.29,
          "en": "with the code we define in our app component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 136.29,
          "end": 138.53,
          "en": "Now, some styling would be nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.53,
          "end": 142.16,
          "en": "And, for this, I attached the index.css file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 142.16,
          "end": 144.43,
          "en": "which you also find attached here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.43,
          "end": 148.11,
          "en": "which contains some basic styling for this first demo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 148.11,
          "end": 151.59,
          "en": "You can simply replace your index.css file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 151.59,
          "end": 153.66,
          "en": "with the attached one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.66,
          "end": 157.38,
          "en": "And if you do that and reload, it looks a bit nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.38,
          "end": 161.87,
          "en": "And we can also, now, add some CSS classes here to this code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.87,
          "end": 165.57999999999998,
          "en": "some CSS classes that will also influence the styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.57999999999998,
          "end": 168.55,
          "en": "For example, to this div, which contains the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 168.55,
          "end": 172.89,
          "en": "and the nested div, I want to add a class of card.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 172.89,
          "end": 176.07,
          "en": "Now, in regular HTML you would do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 176.07,
          "end": 178.41,
          "en": "by adding the class attribute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.41,
          "end": 180.93,
          "en": "and setting this to card, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 181.92,
          "end": 185.62,
          "en": "Now, this is not how you should do it with React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 185.62,
          "end": 190.58,
          "en": "This code here looks like HTML, but it actually isn't.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.58,
          "end": 194.98,
          "en": "Behind the scenes, it is transformed to standard JavaScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.98,
          "end": 199.98,
          "en": "and in standard JavaScript for one class is a keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 200.82999999999998,
          "end": 204.65,
          "en": "but, even more important than that, if you look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 204.65,
          "end": 208.63,
          "en": "at Vanilla Java script, the property name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 208.63,
          "end": 212.84,
          "en": "of a HTML element object for assigning,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 212.84,
          "end": 215.71,
          "en": "or for setting the CSS classes on that object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 215.71,
          "end": 219.43,
          "en": "is actually class name, not class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 219.43,
          "end": 222.36,
          "en": "That's just how Vanilla JavaScript works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 222.36,
          "end": 224.63,
          "en": "And therefore, here, the attribute name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 224.63,
          "end": 227.28,
          "en": "actually, also is class name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 227.28,
          "end": 231.38,
          "en": "Now, again, this can be confusing because it looks like HTML",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 231.38,
          "end": 235,
          "en": "and in standard HTML that would be class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235,
          "end": 238.54,
          "en": "But since this isn't HTML since this, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 238.54,
          "end": 242.64,
          "en": "is JavaScript, just looking differently,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 242.64,
          "end": 246.87,
          "en": "We need to keep minor things like this in mind.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 246.87,
          "end": 248.95,
          "en": "Now, the good news is, however, that this is one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 248.95,
          "end": 253.45,
          "en": "of the very rare cases where the attribute name differs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 253.45,
          "end": 255.73,
          "en": "from the property name, and we have to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 255.73,
          "end": 258.26,
          "en": "the property name here and, hence, we don't use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 258.26,
          "end": 261.4,
          "en": "what we would write in standard HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 261.4,
          "end": 265.13,
          "en": "In most cases you can write standard HTML code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 265.13,
          "end": 270,
          "en": "and the class name is the most prominent, special case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 270,
          "end": 273.07,
          "en": "in React, where you assign a CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 273.07,
          "end": 275.18,
          "en": "to an element with class name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 275.18,
          "end": 279.343,
          "en": "as a attribute, in quotes, added to an element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 280.2,
          "end": 282.47,
          "en": "But, with that, if we save this again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 282.47,
          "end": 285.343,
          "en": "now, we have this card look off this todo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 286.49,
          "end": 288.25,
          "en": "Now, there are a couple of other classes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 288.25,
          "end": 290.03,
          "en": "that should be added, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 290.03,
          "end": 292.14,
          "en": "on this div, which holds the button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 292.14,
          "end": 295.89,
          "en": "you should add a class name of actions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 295.89,
          "end": 298.35,
          "en": "And on the button here, we add a class name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 298.35,
          "end": 303.28,
          "en": "of btn for button, we do all of that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 303.28,
          "end": 305.943,
          "en": "that's the look we get and that looks a bit nicer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 308.02,
          "end": 309.95,
          "en": "So, now, we also added some styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 309.95,
          "end": 313.56,
          "en": "to our first component simply by changing the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 313.56,
          "end": 317.76,
          "en": "in the index.css file and adding a couple of classes here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 317.76,
          "end": 321.34,
          "en": "and therefore our first component is taking shape.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 321.34,
          "end": 325.29,
          "en": "However, at the moment, all the code is in one component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 325.29,
          "end": 327.03,
          "en": "and there are a couple of reasons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 327.03,
          "end": 329.03,
          "en": "why we might want to split that up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 329.03,
          "end": 332.563,
          "en": "and also make our component a bit more flexible.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
